WEBVTT

01:31.937 --> 01:37.255
[Flourished Peony]

01:37.255 --> 01:40.314
[Episode 30]

01:55.040 --> 01:56.799
My lord, the bride has arrived.

02:15.400 --> 02:21.674
♫ In endless Chang'an,
the zither's melody distant ♫

02:23.528 --> 02:30.212
♫ Plum and willow trees bask in the sunshine,
as splendor returns with the year ♫

02:30.888 --> 02:38.086
♫ Copper palace battlements,
songs and dances, glass goblets ♫

02:39.080 --> 02:47.432
♫ Idle clouds and duckweed,
a thousand flowers burst forth ♫

02:47.432 --> 02:54.975
♫ Time passes gracefully,
affairs settle like fading smoke ♫

02:55.629 --> 03:03.816
♫ Let the years go by,
carried by the wind to early desires ♫

03:09.120 --> 03:10.600
Where is your poetry for removing the fan?

03:13.000 --> 03:14.560
I seldom see you in this attire,

03:15.439 --> 03:16.639
and for a moment, my mind went blank.

03:17.639 --> 03:19.048
I forgot it.

03:25.560 --> 03:27.120
We can let it slide

03:27.120 --> 03:29.000
with the fan-removing ritual.

03:29.000 --> 03:30.840
There's still the washing ritual.

03:30.840 --> 03:32.000
The couple

03:32.000 --> 03:33.199
wash together at the same time

03:33.199 --> 03:34.280
to signify purity.

03:40.200 --> 03:47.083
♫ The distant night sky strewn with stars,
reflecting the lovely moon ♫

03:48.384 --> 03:55.078
♫ The peony's magnificent beauty
fills the Fragrance Garden ♫

03:55.835 --> 04:03.137
♫ With a heart as my lantern,
I don't mind the distant mountain paths ♫

04:03.821 --> 04:12.130
♫ The flute's sound,
a fleeting life's wishes fulfilled ♫

04:12.130 --> 04:19.561
♫ Time passes gracefully,
affairs settle like fading smoke ♫

04:24.720 --> 04:27.439
Don't play with me. This makeup
took a long time for Chun and Fu

04:27.439 --> 04:28.480
to put on.

04:29.759 --> 04:31.160
Mr. Xu, look at her.

04:31.160 --> 04:32.160
Shut up.

04:32.160 --> 04:33.439
Just wipe your hands.

04:37.076 --> 04:44.526
♫ Still cherish the moon of my hometown,
to meet for long ♫

05:07.000 --> 05:08.920
Next is the joint meal ritual.

05:09.439 --> 05:10.639
The couple

05:10.639 --> 05:12.959
share the meat of the same animal,

05:12.959 --> 05:15.360
symbolizing that the two
are united as one family,

05:15.360 --> 05:17.560
sharing weal and woe, supporting each other.

05:37.959 --> 05:39.400
Choose one.

06:30.560 --> 06:33.399
In joint meal and united cups,
husband and wife are one.

06:33.399 --> 06:34.720
Two hearts joined as a whole.

06:34.720 --> 06:36.120
Eternal happiness and prosperity.

06:47.759 --> 06:49.600
What else is there? Mother.

06:51.000 --> 06:53.399
Hair braiding, and bridal chamber.

06:54.360 --> 07:04.519
- Bridal chamber.
- Bridal chamber.

07:05.800 --> 07:07.000
As for the final step,

07:07.000 --> 07:08.639
we won't skimp on it.

07:08.639 --> 07:09.639
The bridal chamber's charm

07:09.639 --> 07:10.879
lies in mutual affection.

07:11.600 --> 07:13.160
With everyone watching so attentively,

07:14.000 --> 07:15.160
it's perhaps not quite proper.

08:07.800 --> 08:09.360
I am of an old age.

08:09.360 --> 08:11.319
I cannot look upon these juvenile affections.

08:11.920 --> 08:13.160
You can watch.

08:14.399 --> 08:16.639
Remember to cultivate oneself
and follow ceremonies.

08:16.639 --> 08:17.879
That's how this joyous event

08:17.879 --> 08:18.959
can be perfectly blissful.

08:25.680 --> 08:26.800
Me too.

08:26.800 --> 08:27.920
I'm of a certain age now.

08:27.920 --> 08:29.519
I won't join in this bustle.

08:29.519 --> 08:31.199
Have a good time in the bridal chamber.

08:57.576 --> 09:00.072
♫ If the heart is like frost ♫

09:00.072 --> 09:04.136
♫ Congealing so much of the past ♫

09:04.136 --> 09:06.408
♫ It sinks into your gaze ♫

09:06.408 --> 09:10.334
♫ Melting and flowing with you ♫

09:10.334 --> 09:12.680
♫ If love is like frost ♫

09:13.199 --> 09:17.000
♫ Can this ten thousand miles
of roaming winds and waves ♫

09:17.000 --> 09:18.792
♫ Can it ♫

09:18.792 --> 09:23.408
♫ Finally touch a sunny day ♫

09:25.519 --> 09:27.200
Is it heavy?

09:27.200 --> 09:29.000
Should I help you

09:29.000 --> 09:30.312
take it off?

09:31.944 --> 09:34.971
♫ Fleecy clouds in the sky ♫

09:34.971 --> 09:38.440
♫ Seeking a place to rest ♫

09:39.816 --> 09:45.992
♫ The moon falls on my shoulder,
a path of dim yellow ♫

09:45.992 --> 09:51.076
♫ Silk grows, sprouting longing ♫

09:51.076 --> 09:53.768
♫ If the heart is like frost ♫

09:53.768 --> 09:57.600
♫ What's the harm in a life of solitude ♫

09:57.600 --> 10:00.040
♫ Yet you shine as light ♫

10:00.040 --> 10:04.014
♫ Piercing through my heart ♫

10:04.014 --> 10:06.248
♫ If love is like frost ♫

10:06.248 --> 10:10.760
♫ There's a flickering candle ♫

10:10.760 --> 10:12.328
♫ No words are said ♫

10:12.328 --> 10:14.408
♫ Yet for you ♫

10:15.225 --> 10:17.736
♫ I'll go ahead ♫

10:32.120 --> 10:34.679
Then, I'll help you take it off, too.

10:48.200 --> 10:49.240
Old Xu says

10:50.399 --> 10:51.679
we must cultivate ourselves
and follow ceremonies.

10:55.240 --> 10:56.712
Right, right.

10:58.792 --> 11:04.680
♫ Snow lashes against thorns and wilds ♫

11:05.919 --> 11:07.440
Comb once to the end,

11:08.559 --> 11:10.480
no need to worry about wealth and honor.

11:12.200 --> 11:13.639
Then you should comb more.

11:13.639 --> 11:15.639
Comb until we're the richest under the heavens.

11:16.616 --> 11:18.320
♫ A thousand lines of yearning ♫

11:18.320 --> 11:19.919
Comb twice to the end,

11:20.559 --> 11:22.440
no illness and no worries.

11:23.639 --> 11:25.159
This sounds pretty good, too.

11:27.200 --> 11:28.679
Comb thrice to the tip.

11:29.672 --> 11:31.216
♫ Flowers bloom and fall ♫

11:31.216 --> 11:32.440
♫ Only wishing for you ♫

11:32.440 --> 11:34.399
Mutual love and respect.

11:34.399 --> 11:36.399
United heart jade

11:38.840 --> 11:40.039
with a beginning and an end,

11:40.879 --> 11:43.480
means being wealthy together in this life.

11:47.080 --> 11:48.720
I promise you the last line.

11:48.720 --> 11:50.519
Together wealthy in this life.

11:51.360 --> 11:52.680
I'll never go back on my word.

11:54.159 --> 11:55.799
Me too.

11:55.799 --> 11:56.840
I'll never go back on my word.

12:06.600 --> 12:08.399
Can we skip this one?

12:08.399 --> 12:09.399
It hasn't been easy

12:09.399 --> 12:10.440
for my hair to grow out.

12:10.440 --> 12:11.880
Let's skip it.

12:30.879 --> 12:32.360
Anyway,

12:32.360 --> 12:33.720
I entrust this lock of my hair to you,

12:34.960 --> 12:37.000
if you comb out some hair

12:37.000 --> 12:38.360
and are willing to gather it and tuck it in,

12:39.519 --> 12:40.559
we can consider it as having joined hair.

12:46.120 --> 12:47.879
This sounds somewhat scary.

13:02.519 --> 13:04.200
My aunt traveled by boat to a foreign land.

13:04.200 --> 13:05.360
Upon learning that she missed
our wedding feast,

13:05.360 --> 13:07.159
she was furious.

13:07.159 --> 13:09.080
She ordered her men to speed up the horses

13:09.080 --> 13:10.360
and deliver this congratulatory gift to you.

13:13.159 --> 13:14.919
It's not some valuable item anyway.

13:14.919 --> 13:16.759
It happens that you've recently
opened a new shop,

13:16.759 --> 13:18.440
tired with disheveled hair and dim strands.

13:19.080 --> 13:21.360
Combing more can also reduce some headaches.

13:24.080 --> 13:26.480
Okay, then I will sponge off your aunt's

13:26.480 --> 13:28.039
fortune of being wealthy without restraint.

13:30.279 --> 13:31.960
This comb looks really beautiful,

13:32.519 --> 13:34.519
exquisite in appearance.

13:34.519 --> 13:35.639
Chun is currently developing

13:35.639 --> 13:37.519
Yunbin Pill that could make
a woman's hair lush.

13:38.399 --> 13:40.600
I can make a batch of sandalwood
ones according to this pattern

13:40.600 --> 13:41.639
and sell them in a set.

13:42.440 --> 13:44.240
Wouldn't we make even more money this way?

13:50.279 --> 13:52.639
Sandalwood not only has
the effect of preventing hair loss

13:52.639 --> 13:54.440
but also can reduce wind-heat,
swelling, and pain.

13:54.960 --> 13:57.679
It perfectly matches my Yunbin Pill.

13:57.679 --> 14:00.320
A token of love is important.

14:00.320 --> 14:02.159
How can he send her off with a comb?

14:04.799 --> 14:06.480
I'll tell you a secret.

14:06.480 --> 14:07.480
But you must not spread it around.

14:09.399 --> 14:10.600
This comb

14:10.600 --> 14:12.240
is a treasured item of the young master.

14:12.919 --> 14:14.279
Its worth is not about the price.

14:16.000 --> 14:18.039
It was a personal belonging
of my lord's late mother.

14:18.679 --> 14:20.879
The lady once said when she was still alive,

14:21.440 --> 14:23.360
if her son were to marry in the future,

14:23.360 --> 14:24.919
she must gift this item to the bride,

14:25.919 --> 14:27.759
hoping that my lord and his wife

14:27.759 --> 14:29.240
could be united in marriage and heart

14:29.919 --> 14:31.496
and grow old together.

14:41.159 --> 14:42.720
The united-hair ceremony is complete.

14:42.720 --> 14:44.559
As for the bridal chamber to follow,

14:44.559 --> 14:46.519
if you continue to eavesdrop here,

14:46.519 --> 14:47.559
I won't have mercy.

14:48.960 --> 14:50.039
Yes.

14:50.039 --> 14:51.879
Let's go.

14:51.879 --> 14:53.759
My mother mentioned the bridal chamber.

14:53.759 --> 14:55.639
Are we not watching anymore?

14:55.639 --> 14:57.799
Wait, we're watching the bridal chamber.

14:57.799 --> 14:58.919
Why aren't you watching anymore?

15:09.960 --> 15:10.960
Come on over.

15:11.759 --> 15:13.192
Come on.

15:16.919 --> 15:18.519
The Bureau of Beds

15:18.519 --> 15:20.039
is quite wealthy

15:20.039 --> 15:21.799
to scatter so much money around.

15:22.519 --> 15:24.240
What a pity it's not Kaiyuan Tongbao.

15:24.240 --> 15:25.720
Otherwise, we could have made a big profit.

15:26.519 --> 15:28.399
These specially made money for scattering

15:28.399 --> 15:29.440
aim for good luck

15:29.440 --> 15:30.519
and a harmonious union.

15:31.120 --> 15:32.559
It's not for you to fixate on the money.

15:39.240 --> 15:40.456
I'm hungry too.

15:45.120 --> 15:46.504
Let's eat together.

15:48.399 --> 15:49.480
That's great.

15:49.480 --> 15:50.799
I'm starving.

15:57.879 --> 15:59.159
However you were before,

15:59.159 --> 16:00.840
you must remain so in the future.

16:00.840 --> 16:02.440
No need to act all prim and proper

16:02.440 --> 16:04.080
because you married a high official.

16:04.080 --> 16:05.480
You needn't mind those empty
titles and ceremonies.

16:06.279 --> 16:07.440
As for your business dealings,

16:07.440 --> 16:08.519
you can continue as before.

16:09.519 --> 16:10.559
If any censor impeaches,

16:11.279 --> 16:12.616
I'll handle it.

16:20.279 --> 16:22.879
The last time I married, it was real.

16:23.559 --> 16:24.639
But the wedding

16:24.639 --> 16:25.759
was utterly absurd.

16:27.159 --> 16:28.919
I suppress my true nature every day,

16:29.600 --> 16:32.480
pretending to be the virtuous
and proper Young Madam of the Liu family

16:32.480 --> 16:33.600
without a single day of joy.

16:35.559 --> 16:36.559
But this time,

16:37.120 --> 16:38.360
although it's a sham marriage,

16:40.080 --> 16:42.279
I can be the real He Weifang.

16:48.639 --> 16:50.039
To find a true friend in life

16:51.879 --> 16:53.448
is enough.

17:00.320 --> 17:01.800
Yes, indeed.

17:05.680 --> 17:06.824
Let's drink.

17:13.599 --> 17:14.960
If in the future,

17:14.960 --> 17:16.720
you meet someone you truly love.

17:19.240 --> 17:20.359
Rest assured,

17:20.359 --> 17:21.559
I won't take the bet money.

17:22.240 --> 17:24.000
I will personally write a letter of release.

17:24.000 --> 17:25.839
I will definitely not mess up your good match.

17:28.759 --> 17:30.088
Sure.

17:41.720 --> 17:43.200
My lord.

17:43.200 --> 17:44.759
Go away.

17:44.759 --> 17:45.839
My lord.

17:45.839 --> 17:46.960
Although you are marrying into the family,

17:46.960 --> 17:48.519
at the wedding banquet, His Majesty decreed

17:48.519 --> 17:50.640
to promote you to Deputy Transport
Officer of all regions.

17:50.640 --> 17:52.000
This position controls the grain transport.

17:52.000 --> 17:53.279
It's exactly what you were hoping for.

17:53.279 --> 17:54.920
You can make your mark in the days to come.

17:58.000 --> 17:59.000
How am I different

17:59.000 --> 18:01.079
from He Weifang when she married

18:01.079 --> 18:02.119
into the Liu family in the past?

18:04.279 --> 18:06.079
Officials trample on merchants.

18:06.920 --> 18:08.640
Royal relatives trample on officials.

18:09.359 --> 18:10.920
One layer oppresses another.

18:10.920 --> 18:14.056
♫ Helpless, to draw the sword
and cut through water ♫

18:15.480 --> 18:17.279
If one does not climb to the highest place,

18:20.039 --> 18:22.200
one will forever be meat on the chopping block.

18:24.119 --> 18:25.240
My lord, don't say that.

18:26.359 --> 18:27.640
You're scaring me.

18:30.400 --> 18:31.816
Scared?

18:34.079 --> 18:35.359
What are you scared of?

18:37.720 --> 18:40.279
I will be a good son-in-law.

18:41.960 --> 18:43.160
I will manage

18:43.880 --> 18:45.599
the grain transport well.

18:58.319 --> 18:59.432
My lord.

19:05.799 --> 19:07.319
My lord.

19:07.319 --> 19:08.559
Your leg can't stand the cold.

19:09.079 --> 19:10.240
It's just a few vases of flowers.

19:12.359 --> 19:13.640
You don't know.

19:14.599 --> 19:16.008
These flowers

19:17.079 --> 19:18.536
can't be rained on.

19:20.440 --> 19:21.839
My Lord.

19:21.839 --> 19:23.359
Peonies can't be rained upon.

19:24.079 --> 19:25.279
But this is a Thousand-Petal Lotus.

19:25.839 --> 19:26.880
The blooming period has passed.

19:27.720 --> 19:29.200
The peonies are long gone.

19:36.424 --> 19:39.592
♫ How much love goes against desire ♫

19:39.592 --> 19:43.816
♫ How many different paths
lead to the same end ♫

19:44.420 --> 19:47.034
♫ Upon turning around, who is still there ♫

19:48.200 --> 19:49.200
Thousand-Petal Lotus?

19:51.759 --> 19:53.680
Thousand-leaf precious lotus.

19:53.680 --> 19:55.079
Manifested as the Tathagata.

19:57.640 --> 19:59.240
If there truly are gods and Buddhas,

20:00.319 --> 20:01.559
do they know of my suffering?

20:02.559 --> 20:03.640
Will they save me?

20:07.688 --> 20:14.891
♫ If I never come back ♫

20:15.759 --> 20:16.904
My Lord.

20:22.408 --> 20:26.210
♫ Waiting for the flowers to bloom ♫

20:28.200 --> 20:29.704
Tell the entire household.

20:30.319 --> 20:32.599
Don't let me see a single peony
or a petal of a lotus

20:33.240 --> 20:34.359
in the mansion.

20:34.920 --> 20:36.488
Yes.

20:38.870 --> 20:42.280
[…]

20:49.319 --> 20:51.279
My lord is looking bright and spirited today.

20:51.279 --> 20:52.880
Congratulations to my lord
for finding a match made in heaven,

20:52.880 --> 20:54.472
wishing you lasting fortune.

20:55.440 --> 20:56.920
Congratulations to my lord
on your joyous wedding,

20:56.920 --> 20:57.960
wishing you continuous harmony.

20:59.240 --> 21:00.680
Smooth talker.

21:01.240 --> 21:03.079
I like it.

21:03.079 --> 21:04.079
Reward.

21:04.079 --> 21:05.224
- Thank you, My lord.
- Thank you, My lord.

21:07.119 --> 21:09.359
Congratulations my lord, my best wishes to you.

21:09.359 --> 21:11.160
Reward.

21:11.160 --> 21:13.480
- Congratulations, my lord.
- Best wishes to my lord.

21:14.680 --> 21:16.559
Reward them all.

21:16.559 --> 21:17.839
- Thank you, My lord.
- Thank you, My lord.

21:20.400 --> 21:21.672
Watch your step.

21:25.319 --> 21:26.839
The bridal chamber was last night,

21:26.839 --> 21:28.279
and they are moving today.

21:28.839 --> 21:30.000
Can this

21:30.000 --> 21:32.079
young madam be more heartless?

21:35.920 --> 21:37.000
Fu.

21:37.000 --> 21:38.200
Where is Mudan?

21:38.200 --> 21:39.560
What are you doing?

21:40.720 --> 21:42.599
Mudan went early in the morning
to refurbish the Fragrance Garden.

21:43.240 --> 21:45.480
I will move to live there from now on.

21:46.079 --> 21:47.319
During this period,

21:47.319 --> 21:48.400
thank you, Mr. Jiang, for everything.

21:49.759 --> 21:51.048
Let's go.

21:56.680 --> 21:57.960
See you around.

22:02.400 --> 22:03.839
She's moving out?

22:05.680 --> 22:07.000
I thought the Fragrance Garden was only

22:07.000 --> 22:08.319
for sightseeing and doing business.

22:09.440 --> 22:10.519
If she misses it,

22:11.119 --> 22:13.279
she can just move there and stay
for a few days now and then, right?

22:14.880 --> 22:17.039
I sneaked off to see the Fragrance Garden.

22:17.039 --> 22:18.559
There are many houses over there,

22:18.559 --> 22:20.960
with pavilions, waterside galleries,
mountains built, and lakes pierced through.

22:21.640 --> 22:23.319
Indeed, it is much more comfortable
than living in this small courtyard.

22:24.799 --> 22:26.359
My lord, are you

22:26.359 --> 22:27.720
reluctant to let the young lady leave?

22:30.400 --> 22:31.599
What do you mean?

22:32.119 --> 22:34.440
We married yesterday,
and she's moving out today.

22:34.440 --> 22:35.759
Where is the face of me, the Floral Envoy?

22:42.119 --> 22:44.279
Luckily, there are quite a few
furnishings in the house.

22:44.279 --> 22:45.559
It can't be all moved in a short time.

22:47.960 --> 22:49.279
Hurry to Fragrance Garden
and keep an eye on it for me.

22:50.240 --> 22:51.400
What should I say

22:51.400 --> 22:52.519
when I see the young lady?

22:53.240 --> 22:55.440
Should I say you are reluctant to let her go

22:55.440 --> 22:56.640
and want to ask her to come back?

22:57.200 --> 22:58.599
Or do I say

22:58.599 --> 23:00.200
that moving away the day after the wedding

23:00.200 --> 23:01.608
is against propriety.

23:04.240 --> 23:05.519
Just say

23:05.519 --> 23:06.599
that she has regained the garden,

23:06.599 --> 23:07.640
and I, her husband, am happy for her.

23:08.200 --> 23:10.039
But the garden refurbishment involves
many people and is complicated.

23:10.039 --> 23:11.440
I'm afraid that she will overexert herself.

23:11.440 --> 23:12.559
So I am willing to lend a hand.

23:13.920 --> 23:15.368
Understood.

23:52.480 --> 23:53.768
Slow down.

23:53.768 --> 23:56.079
[Flower Cultivating Soil]

23:56.079 --> 23:57.119
Come, give me a hand.

23:57.119 --> 24:00.440
- Coming, three, two, one.
- Be careful.

24:19.359 --> 24:21.640
Mudan, let's go there together.

24:26.480 --> 24:27.720
Be careful.

24:32.599 --> 24:33.736
Come on.

25:01.359 --> 25:03.400
If we could let those who are
keen on admiring flowers

25:04.240 --> 25:05.880
all enter the garden to take in
the full view of the blossoming beauty.

25:08.599 --> 25:09.799
Mother's spirit in heaven

25:09.799 --> 25:11.039
must be very pleased.

25:15.759 --> 25:17.000
Young lady.

25:20.880 --> 25:22.799
The renovation of the old garden
is a complex affair.

25:22.799 --> 25:24.599
Whether it's labor or materials,

25:24.599 --> 25:26.400
the lord is willing to help out.

25:28.160 --> 25:29.359
Reconstruction of the Fragrance Garden

25:29.359 --> 25:31.000
requires personal involvement.

25:31.000 --> 25:32.759
Only then can I truly feel

25:32.759 --> 25:34.000
the joy of regaining what was lost.

25:34.519 --> 25:35.559
Moreover,

25:35.559 --> 25:37.519
Mr. Jiang has already helped me a lot.

25:38.240 --> 25:39.799
I shall take care of

25:39.799 --> 25:41.319
the refurbishing of the garden myself.

25:41.319 --> 25:42.319
No need to trouble Mr. Jiang any further.

25:44.559 --> 25:45.599
It's not good.

25:45.599 --> 25:46.792
It's bad. It's bad.

25:47.400 --> 25:48.400
- What's wrong?
- This is bad.

25:48.400 --> 25:50.200
What happened? Why are you panicking?

25:50.200 --> 25:51.920
An old servant of this garden heard
that the garden was going to change ownership.

25:51.920 --> 25:53.160
They refuse to leave

25:53.160 --> 25:54.200
and are threatening to hang themselves.

25:55.559 --> 25:56.799
Where are they?

25:56.799 --> 25:58.359
Over there, hurry, move quickly!

25:59.920 --> 26:02.039
Let go of me, let me go!

26:02.039 --> 26:03.039
Come down quickly!

26:03.039 --> 26:05.279
Let go of me, release me!

26:05.279 --> 26:06.960
- It's her, it's her.
- Make way, please.

26:06.960 --> 26:08.599
Let go of me, release me!

26:08.599 --> 26:10.440
Release me, what's wrong with you?

26:10.440 --> 26:11.720
Leave me alone.

26:11.720 --> 26:12.759
Move aside, move aside!

26:12.759 --> 26:14.920
Everyone step back, it's nothing.
Don't worry about her.

26:16.279 --> 26:18.200
Go ahead and hang.

26:20.240 --> 26:21.400
Why are you stopping?

26:24.039 --> 26:26.039
This hemp rope has a slipknot.

26:26.039 --> 26:27.799
It's impossible to die from it.

26:27.799 --> 26:29.400
If you truly wish to seek death,

26:29.400 --> 26:30.440
it's more convenient to hang

26:30.440 --> 26:31.799
from the beam at night.

26:34.119 --> 26:36.079
Madam, please feel free
to say what you want to do.

26:39.160 --> 26:40.400
So, you are Lady He.

26:41.039 --> 26:42.359
You're young,

26:42.359 --> 26:43.880
but how can you be so mean?

26:45.319 --> 26:46.480
I just arrived.

26:46.480 --> 26:48.799
I haven't said or done anything yet.

26:48.799 --> 26:51.039
You come up and try
to intimidate me right away.

26:51.039 --> 26:52.960
Should I still be pleasant to you?

26:56.799 --> 26:58.240
You are obviously a perceptive person.

26:58.240 --> 27:00.039
So I'll just speak frankly.

27:00.039 --> 27:01.680
I've been attending to this garden for so long.

27:01.680 --> 27:04.000
Whenever the ownership changes,
they want to drive me away.

27:04.000 --> 27:05.440
But now I'm old.

27:05.440 --> 27:06.880
I don't want to be troubled anymore.

27:06.880 --> 27:09.000
I earnestly request that you,
madam, let me stay.

27:10.440 --> 27:12.359
I've investigated the details of all
previous servants of this garden

27:12.359 --> 27:14.359
on my lord's orders.

27:14.359 --> 27:15.480
This woman's surname is Tang,

27:15.480 --> 27:17.079
known as Madam Tang.

27:17.079 --> 27:18.599
When the previous owner sold the garden,

27:18.599 --> 27:19.640
she was dismissed.

27:20.240 --> 27:21.240
But later,

27:21.240 --> 27:22.640
when Guild Head Lv took over,

27:22.640 --> 27:24.200
she also made a scene
by pretending to hang herself once.

27:24.720 --> 27:25.720
Guild Head Lv couldn't win against her,

27:25.720 --> 27:27.304
so he agreed to let her stay.

27:28.599 --> 27:30.960
Madam Tang is so reluctant to leave this place,

27:30.960 --> 27:32.400
sparing no effort in seeking death.

27:32.400 --> 27:35.240
- Perhaps there is some other hidden affair?
- I…

27:35.240 --> 27:37.400
This Madam Tang has a son.

27:37.400 --> 27:38.680
Last year, because he committed

27:38.680 --> 27:40.599
theft in the county lieutenant's residence.

27:40.599 --> 27:42.480
He left her alone to avoid disaster.

27:42.480 --> 27:43.960
And so far, there has been no news.

27:43.960 --> 27:45.000
My son was framed.

27:45.000 --> 27:46.640
He abandoned me only to escape the trouble.

27:46.640 --> 27:48.480
This damned kid will surely come back.

27:49.319 --> 27:50.319
My lady.

27:50.319 --> 27:52.200
This is the home of my son and me.

27:52.200 --> 27:53.400
If I leave,

27:53.400 --> 27:56.039
he won't be able to find me anymore
when he returns one day.

27:56.039 --> 27:58.000
I earnestly request you to let me stay.

27:58.000 --> 28:00.839
Please keep me here, please.

28:00.839 --> 28:02.319
Madam Tang, please get up quickly.

28:02.319 --> 28:03.656
Get up quickly.

28:06.279 --> 28:08.119
Madame, I am not cold-hearted.

28:08.640 --> 28:10.160
I also pity the kind heart of a mother.

28:10.960 --> 28:13.000
But business is business.

28:13.680 --> 28:15.039
I am renovating the Fragrance Garden

28:15.039 --> 28:16.759
to provide a place for guests
to relax and enjoy the flowers.

28:18.039 --> 28:20.720
Food, wine, music, and scenery

28:20.720 --> 28:22.160
all require meticulous care.

28:22.759 --> 28:25.160
We're renovating today and running
a business in the future.

28:25.160 --> 28:26.960
If you are truly capable,

28:26.960 --> 28:28.319
of course, I will keep you.

28:29.000 --> 28:30.920
But if not…

28:30.920 --> 28:32.359
Since you are running a business,

28:32.359 --> 28:34.279
there must be a need for a steward.

28:34.279 --> 28:35.319
I used to be

28:35.319 --> 28:36.720
the stewardess of this garden,

28:36.720 --> 28:38.640
managing purchases for over a hundred people

28:38.640 --> 28:40.599
without a single mistake.

28:41.519 --> 28:43.000
Stewardship talents

28:44.000 --> 28:45.000
are not rare.

28:45.880 --> 28:47.480
What about hiring people?

28:47.480 --> 28:49.039
My father came from a craftsman background.

28:49.039 --> 28:50.440
All of Chang'an's artisans,

28:50.440 --> 28:52.640
whether they are tilers,
embroiderers, or musicians,

28:52.640 --> 28:54.839
no one doesn't give face to Madam Tang.

28:56.200 --> 28:58.839
Mudan, our garden is undergoing
renovation and opening.

28:58.839 --> 29:00.799
We indeed need quite a number of workers.

29:00.799 --> 29:02.559
And you have high requirements for this.

29:02.559 --> 29:04.680
Why not give her a chance to try?

29:05.920 --> 29:07.279
What kind of person do you want?

29:07.279 --> 29:08.359
Just tell me anything.

29:09.279 --> 29:10.319
Give me three days,

29:10.319 --> 29:12.200
and if I cannot gather the talent you want,

29:12.200 --> 29:13.319
I'll move out myself.

29:15.720 --> 29:17.319
Okay.

29:17.319 --> 29:18.400
Then I'll give you three days.

29:20.039 --> 29:22.559
Thank you, Shopkeeper. Thank you, Shopkeeper.

29:28.640 --> 29:30.319
Just tell me directly
what you want in the future.

29:30.839 --> 29:32.264
Don't make a fuss anymore.

29:38.559 --> 29:39.720
Fine, now, my lord

29:39.720 --> 29:41.359
has lost the opportunity
to help find workers as well.

30:04.240 --> 30:05.519
She hasn't returned for two days.

30:06.319 --> 30:08.000
She should come back tonight, right?

30:09.960 --> 30:10.960
After all, these flowers in the garden

30:10.960 --> 30:12.039
should be taken away, right?

30:24.079 --> 30:25.680
My lord, Prince Ning has arrived.

30:25.680 --> 30:27.759
He says he's here to congratulate
you on taking a concubine,

30:27.759 --> 30:28.920
bringing several boxes of treasures.

30:34.279 --> 30:36.000
My lady has been impertinent
to the County Princess,

30:36.680 --> 30:37.960
and it's proper for me to make amends.

30:38.559 --> 30:40.200
How dare I trouble Your Highness to visit?

30:40.720 --> 30:41.880
I'm afraid it is overflattering for her.

30:42.960 --> 30:44.079
The injury of Youzhen

30:44.680 --> 30:47.119
is ultimately because that horse
was unruly and hard to tame.

30:47.839 --> 30:49.759
How can a lowly animal let me

30:50.319 --> 30:52.599
become estranged from Suizhi?

30:54.519 --> 30:55.799
Suizhi.

30:55.799 --> 30:57.200
You finally have a companion.

30:57.960 --> 30:59.160
I am very pleased.

31:00.000 --> 31:01.680
Therefore, this gift is deserved.

31:03.039 --> 31:04.720
However,

31:04.720 --> 31:06.160
this most precious one

31:06.880 --> 31:08.359
requires you

31:08.359 --> 31:09.559
to open it personally.

31:19.880 --> 31:21.160
Suizhi, don't panic.

31:22.680 --> 31:24.720
Lianzhou, come out.

31:36.440 --> 31:37.800
Mr. Jiang.

31:40.480 --> 31:42.519
Your Highness, what is this?

31:44.640 --> 31:46.599
You once said you were unwilling to marry,

31:46.599 --> 31:48.599
but now you have already taken a concubine.

31:49.160 --> 31:50.640
One more isn't too many.

31:50.640 --> 31:51.759
It's double happiness arriving at the doorstep.

31:53.079 --> 31:54.960
Moreover, it ensures
the continuation of descendants.

31:54.960 --> 31:57.400
Your deceased parents would be pleased.

31:58.039 --> 31:59.599
I think

31:59.599 --> 32:01.359
His Majesty would also be delighted.

32:07.960 --> 32:09.288
Dear husband,

32:10.000 --> 32:11.400
my name is Lianzhou.

32:11.920 --> 32:14.680
My needlework, qin skills and dance skills

32:15.240 --> 32:16.400
have all been trained by masters

32:16.400 --> 32:17.519
invited by His Highness.

32:18.359 --> 32:19.759
As for etiquette and norms,

32:19.759 --> 32:21.519
I have thoroughly practiced
them in the royal household.

32:22.119 --> 32:23.200
I will surely manage the household well

32:23.200 --> 32:24.400
and nurture your mind and spirit

32:25.079 --> 32:26.760
in the future.

32:28.079 --> 32:30.160
Lady Lianzhou is charming and moving,

32:30.160 --> 32:32.279
unparalleled in beauty and art,
a wonderful person.

32:34.200 --> 32:35.799
However, you might not know this,

32:35.799 --> 32:38.240
but my young lady is a jealous type.

32:38.240 --> 32:39.640
I've just taken a concubine three days ago.

32:39.640 --> 32:41.160
And now I am welcoming another
new beauty to my home.

32:41.160 --> 32:42.319
I'm afraid…

32:42.319 --> 32:44.440
I'm afraid the days ahead will not be easy.

32:46.519 --> 32:47.799
If a concubine is prone to jealousy,

32:48.599 --> 32:50.359
that would be disrespecting the lord.

32:52.079 --> 32:53.680
This is indecorous.

32:54.279 --> 32:55.880
Lianzhou.

32:55.880 --> 32:58.079
You must teach her well when the time comes.

32:58.880 --> 33:00.104
Yes.

33:01.640 --> 33:02.856
Suizhi.

33:03.640 --> 33:05.839
In the past, I granted you a marriage,

33:05.839 --> 33:07.336
and you refused it.

33:08.920 --> 33:10.640
Now,

33:10.640 --> 33:12.640
I'm giving you my most beloved foster daughter

33:12.640 --> 33:13.680
as your concubine.

33:14.440 --> 33:15.799
If you refuse again,

33:16.440 --> 33:20.039
do you truly wish to alienate yourself from me?

33:20.599 --> 33:21.599
How could that be?

33:22.160 --> 33:23.799
I hold Your Highness in high regard,

33:23.799 --> 33:26.880
which is why I worry
that Lady Lianzhou will be wronged.

33:27.720 --> 33:29.480
She won't be.

33:29.480 --> 33:30.599
This time, I have even

33:30.599 --> 33:32.440
prepared the banquet

33:32.440 --> 33:33.720
for you and Lianzhou.

33:38.000 --> 33:39.319
Enter.

33:39.319 --> 33:40.599
A few days ago,

33:41.279 --> 33:42.519
you didn't even hold a banquet

33:43.119 --> 33:44.880
for your taking in a concubine.

33:46.039 --> 33:49.559
Today, you and Lianzhou
have a great celebration.

33:49.559 --> 33:52.240
I have specially arranged for the most
capable servant in my mansion

33:52.240 --> 33:53.839
to personally manage it.

33:53.839 --> 33:56.160
It will certainly show
the dignity of both households.

33:59.279 --> 34:00.880
You are so thoughtful, Your Highness.

34:01.759 --> 34:03.400
Presumably, the invitations
for the wedding feast

34:03.920 --> 34:05.240
have also been sent out.

34:07.240 --> 34:08.720
Suizhi, you are naturally carefree,

34:08.720 --> 34:10.760
unwilling to be entangled
in these trivial matters.

34:10.760 --> 34:11.920
So I have taken care of it on your behalf.

34:12.920 --> 34:13.920
Moreover,

34:13.920 --> 34:15.039
I have calculated it.

34:15.639 --> 34:16.920
This morning

34:16.920 --> 34:17.960
is simply

34:17.960 --> 34:20.360
an extremely auspicious day.

34:22.559 --> 34:24.400
Suizhi,

34:24.400 --> 34:26.199
what do you say?

34:33.039 --> 34:35.559
Thank you, Your Highness.

34:39.800 --> 34:41.000
Thank you, Your Highness.

34:41.000 --> 34:42.440
Thank you, My lord.

34:42.440 --> 34:43.639
In the future,

34:43.639 --> 34:45.119
I will surely serve my husband

34:45.119 --> 34:46.159
with all my heart.

34:52.360 --> 34:54.480
To let your little boys and girls

34:54.480 --> 34:56.239
be at ease,

34:56.239 --> 34:59.559
I will not join the banquet tonight.

35:00.719 --> 35:02.559
Lianzhou.

35:02.559 --> 35:03.880
At the banquet,

35:03.880 --> 35:05.760
you must pay great respect

35:05.760 --> 35:07.480
to that jealous lady.

35:08.320 --> 35:09.672
Yes.

35:22.920 --> 35:24.328
Mr. Jiang.

35:25.320 --> 35:26.800
I am still hungover.

35:26.800 --> 35:28.079
I'm unreliable.

35:28.079 --> 35:29.544
Unreliable.

35:32.119 --> 35:34.599
That Madam Tang is really capable.

35:34.599 --> 35:36.039
We switched to the craftsmen she found.

35:36.039 --> 35:37.800
They are very handy.

35:37.800 --> 35:38.880
She has some good bargaining skills

35:38.880 --> 35:40.280
which saved us quite a bit of money.

35:41.679 --> 35:43.000
Let's go and see first.

35:43.000 --> 35:44.488
Okay.

35:47.880 --> 35:49.224
Shopkeeper.

35:50.239 --> 35:51.239
Greetings, everyone.

35:52.159 --> 35:53.320
As per your request,

35:53.320 --> 35:54.360
I have found them for you.

35:55.360 --> 35:57.239
This is the qin player, Tao.

35:57.840 --> 35:59.079
Greetings, Shopkeeper.

35:59.079 --> 36:01.760
Tao, all sorts of instruments
like pipa, lusheng, konghou,

36:01.760 --> 36:03.159
anything you can name,

36:03.159 --> 36:04.320
there is nothing she can't play.

36:05.159 --> 36:06.920
This is the embroiderer, Aman.

36:07.679 --> 36:09.079
Greetings, Shopkeeper.

36:09.079 --> 36:11.559
Aman can do straight and loop stitches.

36:11.559 --> 36:13.840
She is also skilled at stitching
and spinning needles.

36:13.840 --> 36:15.840
Anything you can see can be embroidered.

36:16.800 --> 36:20.360
Jinniang excels in fine cooking techniques
and especially at making wine.

36:20.360 --> 36:21.480
Greetings.

36:21.480 --> 36:22.639
Jinniang.

36:22.639 --> 36:24.039
As for their skills,

36:24.039 --> 36:25.719
you will know once you try.

36:25.719 --> 36:26.719
Tao, come on.

37:25.079 --> 37:26.408
Aman.

37:31.679 --> 37:33.032
Fu.

37:37.480 --> 37:38.519
I'm asking you to appreciate the embroidery.

37:38.519 --> 37:40.296
It smells good.

37:48.039 --> 37:49.039
Jinniang, the wine.

38:09.519 --> 38:10.519
It tastes good.

38:10.519 --> 38:12.039
This wine is called 'Flowers Wine'.

38:13.039 --> 38:14.312
Good wine.

38:20.559 --> 38:22.079
Though I lack talent,

38:22.079 --> 38:24.760
I can see that the three of you
possess exquisite skills,

38:24.760 --> 38:26.679
worthy of being considered
experts in the field.

38:26.679 --> 38:28.119
Why would you be willing to condescend

38:28.119 --> 38:29.119
and come to the Fragrance Garden?

38:32.760 --> 38:34.400
I'm afraid if I say the truth,

38:34.400 --> 38:35.719
you might disdain me.

38:36.519 --> 38:38.519
Shopkeeper, you are unaware.

38:38.519 --> 38:40.760
Jinniang was pawned by her husband
and passed through several hands.

38:40.760 --> 38:42.480
Now she's working at a tavern.

38:42.480 --> 38:43.760
Although she has craftsmanship,

38:43.760 --> 38:45.320
she is envied by her peers.

38:45.320 --> 38:46.559
Because of her gender,

38:46.559 --> 38:48.599
she is belittled by the tavern owner.

38:48.599 --> 38:49.880
Without reclaiming her deed of sale,

38:49.880 --> 38:51.239
she cannot leave.

38:52.360 --> 38:54.639
Tao was originally a noble's daughter,

38:54.639 --> 38:57.320
skilled in zither, chess,
calligraphy, and painting.

38:57.320 --> 38:58.679
But due to her family being convicted,

38:58.679 --> 39:00.239
she was reduced to a low status overnight.

39:00.239 --> 39:02.320
Though a musician, she is without
worries for food and clothing,

39:02.320 --> 39:05.480
she is unwilling to mingle among men every day.

39:05.480 --> 39:07.840
Hearing that the Fragrance Garden
has a female owner,

39:07.840 --> 39:09.519
she naturally wants to make a living here.

39:11.880 --> 39:13.199
As for Aman,

39:14.639 --> 39:16.400
her embroidery skills are excellent,

39:16.400 --> 39:17.599
yet she was sold by her gambler father

39:17.599 --> 39:19.079
into Pingkang House,

39:19.079 --> 39:21.280
unable to utilize her skills.

39:21.280 --> 39:23.239
She has always been saving money
to buy back her freedom.

39:23.239 --> 39:24.599
She asked several embroidery workshops,

39:24.599 --> 39:26.400
but they all refused her because of her status.

39:26.400 --> 39:28.480
Her heart was despondent

39:28.480 --> 39:30.920
until she heard that the Fragrance
Garden was hiring.

39:34.920 --> 39:36.440
I see.

39:36.440 --> 39:37.800
Being a woman,

39:37.800 --> 39:39.559
many things are difficult

39:39.559 --> 39:40.559
to do.

39:41.159 --> 39:42.760
But not everyone

39:42.760 --> 39:44.159
is as brave as you.

39:45.320 --> 39:46.880
After hearing all this,

39:46.880 --> 39:48.880
I have even more respect for the three of you.

39:50.280 --> 39:51.800
Shopkeeper, are you saying

39:51.800 --> 39:53.280
you want to keep them here?

39:54.599 --> 39:56.639
I will go to your current master's place

39:56.639 --> 39:58.079
and redeem your indentures

39:58.599 --> 40:00.360
so you can work with me in the future

40:00.360 --> 40:02.159
and no longer suffer the cold
stares of the world

40:02.159 --> 40:03.440
or be bullied by men.

40:08.280 --> 40:10.519
Thank you so much for your
great kindness, Shopkeeper.

40:10.519 --> 40:11.599
What are you doing?

40:11.599 --> 40:12.719
Get up quickly.

40:12.719 --> 40:14.360
Get up quickly, get up. Please stand.

40:15.280 --> 40:16.520
Everyone, get up.

40:18.000 --> 40:19.760
I am not looking for servants

40:19.760 --> 40:22.159
but for partners who share my aspirations.

40:22.159 --> 40:23.480
As long as you give your all

40:23.480 --> 40:24.840
and show your sincerity

40:24.840 --> 40:26.280
in building the Fragrance Garden with me,

40:26.280 --> 40:28.639
I will surely treat you
generously in the future.

40:28.639 --> 40:29.880
We are willing to lay down our lives

40:29.880 --> 40:30.920
and devote our utmost to help.

40:32.079 --> 40:33.239
Mudan is right.

40:33.239 --> 40:34.360
We, the sons and daughters
of the martial world.

40:34.360 --> 40:35.639
We recognize only the bond of sisterhood.

40:35.639 --> 40:37.079
There are no masters or servants, high or low.

40:37.079 --> 40:38.079
In the future, at this place,

40:38.079 --> 40:39.480
if anyone dares to bully you,

40:39.480 --> 40:40.519
I'll beat him up.

40:41.440 --> 40:43.039
Her fist is really formidable.

40:43.039 --> 40:44.719
She will surely be able to protect
you in the future.

40:48.360 --> 40:49.639
I am truly happy today.

40:50.920 --> 40:52.079
After buying back Fragrance Garden

40:52.079 --> 40:53.440
and achieving my wish,

40:54.159 --> 40:55.679
I felt somewhat lost.

40:56.519 --> 40:58.320
But seeing you all today

40:58.320 --> 41:00.239
has given me new hopes.

41:01.360 --> 41:02.519
In the future, I want

41:02.519 --> 41:03.719
to open more shops

41:04.400 --> 41:05.920
so that people like us

41:05.920 --> 41:07.639
can all have a place to belong.

41:07.639 --> 41:09.199
We can use our abilities

41:09.199 --> 41:10.320
to seek wealth and honor together.

41:14.079 --> 41:15.679
On the day I was sold,

41:15.679 --> 41:17.679
I told myself I had no relatives left.

41:18.480 --> 41:21.320
I never expected to meet someone like you.

41:23.360 --> 41:24.840
Don't be sad.

41:26.280 --> 41:28.119
Today is an auspicious day for starting work.

41:28.119 --> 41:29.920
Everyone, come to our house tonight

41:29.920 --> 41:31.280
and have a feast together

41:31.280 --> 41:32.440
to celebrate starting the work, okay?

41:32.440 --> 41:33.800
Okay!

41:33.800 --> 41:35.719
Let's eat meat and drink wine.

41:35.719 --> 41:37.760
Let's drink Flowers Banquet.

41:37.760 --> 41:38.360
- Okay.
- Alright.

41:38.360 --> 41:39.360
It's Flowers Wine.

41:39.360 --> 41:40.519
Flowers Wine.

42:00.238 --> 42:06.512
♫ In endless Chang'an,
the zither's melody distant ♫

42:08.366 --> 42:15.050
♫ Plum and willow trees bask in the sunshine,
as splendor returns with the year ♫

42:15.726 --> 42:22.924
♫ Copper palace battlements,
songs and dances, glass goblets ♫

42:23.918 --> 42:32.270
♫ Idle clouds and duckweed,
a thousand flowers burst forth ♫

42:32.270 --> 42:39.813
♫ Time passes gracefully,
affairs settle like fading smoke ♫

42:40.467 --> 42:48.654
